      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.8
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The head of state, the matchmaker, provided a secret passion revealed through a late-stage endorsement, altering the election result. Paxton will face a Democratic state representative in November, a looming confrontation that could reshape control of the U.S. Senate, signaling a new courtship begins in this U.S. state.",
